      "jp": "ある日の夕方。僕はシーエルフ娘のアズレアさんと一緒に、\n浜辺の見回りに訪れていた。",
      "jp_sha256": "248d6760163bd27373ae35b82f2b682b6acff08008e0dff3c3ef4543cfc834a9",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "어느 날 저녁. 나는 시 엘프 소녀 아즈레아 씨와 함께,\n해변 순찰을 나와 있었다.",
      "message_index_0based": 0,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 9,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "pro-b008-20261106-451bb6a2fb2c21c5",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "077437702273f6df5a5638fdb37aa85ecb518cf4785c144e2d81b267ec6eee92:000002_5832589921147274989:g0:r8",
      "row_index_0based": 8,
      "serialized_row_index": 8,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "ある日の夕方。僕はシーエルフ娘のアズレアさんと一緒に、\n浜辺の見回りに訪れていた。"
      ],
      "speaker": "",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "ad68edcf12b032801f3331551ff6c99c4e620ae838ed2b645808da618f0a1207",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 1,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "まあ、まあ！　ふふ、砂浜の砂は何度踏んでも、\n心地いいものですわ。ね、ご主人様！",
      "jp_sha256": "0a7f6e36c004996f4c8d5e2661242609901fad40cdeca8593bb774e236077afa",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "어머, 어머!　후후, 모래사장의 모래는 몇 번을 밟아도,\n기분이 좋군요. 그렇죠, 주인님!",
      "message_index_0based": 1,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 13,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "pro-b008-20261106-451bb6a2fb2c21c5",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "077437702273f6df5a5638fdb37aa85ecb518cf4785c144e2d81b267ec6eee92:000002_5832589921147274989:g0:r12",
      "row_index_0based": 12,
      "serialized_row_index": 12,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "アズレア",
        "Emt4_Enj",
        "layer_中",
        "",
        "",
        "0.3",
        "",
        "まあ、まあ！　ふふ、砂浜の砂は何度踏んでも、\n心地いいものですわ。ね、ご主人様！",
