      "grid_message_index_0based": 2,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "アズレアさんはちょこまかと砂浜でステップを踏みながら、\n僕へと満面の笑みを浮かべる。とても楽しそうだ。",
      "jp_sha256": "acd94a5039a3f506421b6c1005e9e81e94573cf7112a7a04868e31169a97b966",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "아즈레아 씨는 종종걸음으로 모래사장에서 스텝을 밟으며,\n내게 환한 미소를 지었다. 무척 즐거워 보인다.",
      "message_index_0based": 2,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 21,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "pro-b008-20261106-451bb6a2fb2c21c5",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "077437702273f6df5a5638fdb37aa85ecb518cf4785c144e2d81b267ec6eee92:000002_5832589921147274989:g0:r20",
      "row_index_0based": 20,
      "serialized_row_index": 20,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "アズレアさんはちょこまかと砂浜でステップを踏みながら、\n僕へと満面の笑みを浮かべる。とても楽しそうだ。"
      ],
      "speaker": "",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "82057c364be2b96eea668b038ee6b45c8560ab64931116be94b032f30fb6bd19",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 3,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "今日は見回りについてきてくださり、ありがとうございます。\nとても心強かったです。\nでも、疲れてはいませんか？　まだ陸に来て間もないのに。",
      "jp_sha256": "4bb41dddb5b644e9880218de51fd76decb8fbe238e0ac766d6dc4bc269aa080e",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "오늘 순찰에 따라와 주셔서 감사합니다.\n정말 든든했어요.\n하지만 피곤하지 않으세요?　육지에 온 지 얼마 안 됐는데.",
      "message_index_0based": 3,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 22,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "pro-b008-20261106-451bb6a2fb2c21c5",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
